meta {
  name: 07 Chats
  seq: 8
}

docs {
  `/api/chats`: chats are created, listed (filters and the cursor), changed, read, saved to a
  project, and deleted by their owner, while user B (`otherToken`) gets `404` for user A's chats in
  paths and A's project in queries and bodies. Bruno has no model provider, so these chats hold no
  messages; the route tests on Postgres cover answered chats, unread flags, and edits.
}
